# Images build from the repository root, from the SDK crates and the
# applications only.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/licash
!crates/licash-api
!crates/licash-hub
!crates/licash-lightning
!crates/licash-onchain
!crates/licash-swaps
!crates/licash-wallet
# The recovery contract, on Lichen as vendor/fetch.sh copies it: run it
# before building an image.
!crates/licash-contract
# The hub's statement, of the contract and of its recovery.
!crates/licash-hp
!regtest/Cargo.toml
!vendor/lichen
!apps
**/target
**/tmp
# The Android app and its light client: only the wallet core's manifest is
# needed, a member of the applications' workspace.
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/chain
